+ * written, or -1 on error. The |padding| argument must be one of the
+ * |RSA_*_PADDING| values. If in doubt, |RSA_PKCS1_PADDING| is the most common
+ * but |RSA_PKCS1_PSS_PADDING| (via the |EVP_PKEY| interface) is preferred for
